{"strongs": "H1763", "word": "ᵑ7", "translit": "de.chal", "root": "אול", "morph": "A:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "fear", "definition": "[ דְּחַל ] verb fear (so ᵑ7 Syriac; Biblical Hebrew II. זָחַל ]; — Pe`al Participle active plural דָּֽחְלִין Dan 5:19 , with מִןקֳֿדָם of king, Dan 6:27 , id. of God; passive דְּחִיל terrible Dan 2:31 , feminine דְּחִילָה Dan 7:7 ; Dan 7:19 . Pa`el Imperfect 3 masculine singular suffix וִידֵחֲלִנַּנִי Dan 4:2 the dream made me afraid.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9439')\">BDB9439</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1763')\">H1763</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H2119')\">H2119</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9438')\">BDB9438</entry> | BIBLICAL ARAMAIC | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9440')\">BDB9440</entry></div><p> [<bdbarc>דְּחַל</bdbarc>] <b>verb</b> <highlightword>fear</highlightword> (so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> Syriac; Biblical Hebrew  II. <bdbheb><reflink>זָחַל</reflink></bdbheb>]; — <div class=\"point\"><b>Pe`al</b> <highlight>Participle active</highlight> plural <bdbarc>דָּֽחְלִין</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 5:19\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(27,5,19)\">Dan 5:19</ref>, with <bdbarc>מִןקֳֿדָם</bdbarc> of king, <ref ref=\"Dan 6:27\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(27,6,27)\">Dan 6:27</ref>, <highlight>id.</highlight> of God; <highlight>passive</highlight> <bdbarc>דְּחִיל</bdbarc> <highlight>terrible</highlight> <ref ref=\"Dan 2:31\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,31)\">Dan 2:31</ref>, feminine <bdbheb>דְּחִילָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 7:7\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,7)\">Dan 7:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 7:19\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,19)\">Dan 7:19</ref>. <b>Pa`el</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight